# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Automatic HTTPS Certificates:** Handles secure certificate issuance via Let's Encrypt."
msgstr "**Automatiska HTTPS-certifikat:** Hantera säkra certifikatutfärdande via Let's Encrypt."

