# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Database Composition**"
msgstr "**Databaskomposition**"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Database Composition**   Leverages the `sys-stk-backend` role to stand up your containerized database (PostgreSQL, MariaDB, etc.) with backups and user management."
msgstr "**Databaskomposition** Hävstångar `sys-stk-backend` roll att stå upp din containeriserade databas (PostgreSQL, MariaDBetc.) med säkerhetskopior och användarhantering."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Database Seeding:** Introduced the * multi-database marker for cluster-aware seeding, enabling clean PostgreSQL cluster dumps and clearer seeder semantics."
msgstr "**Database Seeding:** Introducerad * multi-databas markör för kluster-aware seeding, möjliggör ren PostgreSQL kluster dumpar och tydligare seeder semantics."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Database-aware:** consumer apps seed their connection metadata into a central ``databases.csv``, so the same run can dump SQL state alongside the file payload."
msgstr "**Databasmedveten:** konsumentappar frö deras anslutningsmetadata till en central ``databases.csv``, så samma körning kan dumpa SQL-status bredvid filens nyttolast."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Database-aware:** consumer apps seed their connection metadata into a central `databases.csv`, so the same run can dump SQL state alongside the file payload."
