# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Per-family dispatch:** Routes by ``ansible_facts['distribution']`` so the caller never has to gate the role with a ``when:`` clause."
msgstr "**Per-family avsändning:** Routes by ``ansible_facts['distribution']`` så att den som ringer aldrig behöver gate rollen med en ``when:`` klausul."

