# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**SSO via Keycloak:** configured automatically on first deploy."
msgstr "**SSO via KeycloakFrån:** Konfigureras automatiskt vid första installationen."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**SSO via oauth2-proxy with auto-provisioning:** V1 gates all access through the shared Keycloak OIDC client (oauth2-proxy edge). openresty forwards the authenticated identity to n8n as a trusted `Remote-Email` header (`templates/proxy.conf.j2`); an `EXTERNAL_HOOK_FILES` script (`files/hooks.js`, adapted from [PavelSozonov/n8n-community-sso](https://github.com/PavelSozonov/n8n-community-sso)) reads that header, auto-provisions a local n8n user on first sign-in, and issues n8n's own session cookie — so every Keycloak user lands directly in the workflow editor, with no second, n8n-local login step."
msgstr "**SSO via oauth2Proxy med auto-provisioning:** V1 Gates all åtkomst genom den delade Keycloak OIDC-klient (oauth2Proxy Edge). Openresty vidarebefordrar den autentiska identiteten till n8n som betrodd `Remote-Email` header (`templates/proxy.conf.j2`); en `EXTERNAL_HOOK_FILES` skript (`files/hooks.js`, anpassad från [PavelSozonov/n8n-community-sso](https://github.com/PavelSozonov/n8n-community-sso)) Läser den rubriken, auto-provisions en lokal n8Användare på första inloggning och problem n8n's egen session cookie - så varje Keycloak användaren landar direkt i arbetsflödesredaktören, utan någon sekund, n8n-lokal inloggning steg."

# translated-by: libretranslate
