# translated-by: libretranslate
#, python-brace-format
msgid "Cross-service probes (biber denied at prometheus, biber denied at matomo, dashboard tile reachability) are NOT part of the per-role biber persona. They live in the provider's own spec (`web-app-{prometheus,matomo,dashboard}/files/playwright/playwright.spec.js`), parameterised once over the provider's `<NAME>_TARGET_ROLES_JSON` manifest. For the dashboard, the parameterised scenario delegates to `web-app-dashboard/files/playwright/dashboard-card-flow.js::runDashboardCardScenario(page, context, target)`, which owns the tile visibility / iframe-embed / \"Tab\" pop-out assertions in one SPOT."
msgstr "Cross-service probes (Biber nekas på prometheus, biber nekas på matomo, dashboard tile nåability) är inte en del av per-role biber persona. De bor i leverantörens egna spec (`web-app-{prometheus,matomo,dashboard}/files/playwright/playwright.spec.js`)parameteriseras en gång över leverantörens `<NAME>_TARGET_ROLES_JSON` manifest. För instrumentpanelen delegerar det parameteriserade scenariot till `web-app-dashboard/files/playwright/dashboard-card-flow.js::runDashboardCardScenario(page, context, target)`, som äger kakelsynligheten / iframe-embed / \"Tab\" Pop-out påståenden i en SPOT."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Cross-service probes are NOT part of the per-role administrator persona. Dashboard tile reachability is owned by `web-app-dashboard/files/playwright/playwright.spec.js`, which delegates the per-target body to the `runDashboardCardScenario` helper in `dashboard-card-flow.js` (tile visible → click loads in `#main iframe` → header \"Tab\" button pops the embed into a fresh browser tab). That helper is the SPOT for dashboard-tile mechanics; consumer specs MUST NOT reimplement any of those assertions. Prometheus admin-reach and scrape parity are owned by `web-app-prometheus/files/playwright/playwright.spec.js`. Matomo admin-reach and tracker presence are owned by `web-app-matomo/files/playwright/playwright.spec.js`. Each provider parameterises the assertion over its `<NAME>_TARGET_ROLES_JSON` manifest."
msgstr "Cross-service probes är inte en del av per roll administratör persona. Dashboard kakel tillgänglighet ägs av `web-app-dashboard/files/playwright/playwright.spec.js`, som delegerar per målkroppen till `runDashboardCardScenario` Hjälpare i `dashboard-card-flow.js` (bricka synlig → klicka på laster i `#main iframe` → header \"Tab\" knappen dyker in i en ny webbläsare flik). Denna hjälpare är SPOT för instrumentbräda mekanik; konsumenten specs MÅSTE inte omdirigera någon av dessa påståenden. Prometheus admin-reach och scrape parity ägs av `web-app-prometheus/files/playwright/playwright.spec.js`. Matomo admin-reach och tracker närvaro ägs av `web-app-matomo/files/playwright/playwright.spec.js`. Varje leverantör parametrar påståendet över dess `<NAME>_TARGET_ROLES_JSON` manifest."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Cross-service surface assertions (dashboard tile reachability, prometheus admin-reach and scrape parity, matomo admin-reach and tracker presence, biber-denied-at-prometheus, biber-denied-at-matomo) are owned by the provider's own spec. Each provider parameterises the assertion over its `<NAME>_TARGET_ROLES_JSON` manifest, rendered via `lookup('roles_with_service', '<svc>')`. Consumer roles' personas MUST NOT duplicate these probes."
msgstr "Cross-service yta påståenden (dashboard tile reachability, prometheus admin-reach och scrape parity, matomo admin-reach och tracker närvaro, biber-denied-at-prometheus, biber-denied-at-matomo) ägs av leverantörens egna spec. Varje leverantör parametrar påståendet över dess `<NAME>_TARGET_ROLES_JSON` manifest, rendered via `lookup('roles_with_service', '<svc>')`. Konsumentroller personas måste inte duplicera dessa sonder."

