msgid "Fork PRs cannot publish mirror packages directly, so their runs wait for the `pull_request_target` mirror producer before continuing. The producer mirrors with the Docker Hub credentials only for trusted PRs ([🛡️ Trusted](#trusted-fork-prs-)); untrusted forks mirror anonymously (no organization secrets). See [mirror.md](../image/mirror.md) for the mirroring architecture and naming convention."
msgstr "Fork PR kan inte publicera spegelpaket direkt, så deras körningar väntar på `pull_request_target` spegelproducent innan den fortsätter. Producenten speglar med Docker Hub-uppgifter endast för betrodda PR:er ([🛡️ Förtroende](#trusted-fork-prs-))opålitliga gafflar speglar anonymt (Ingen organisation hemligheter)Se [mirror.md](../image/mirror.md) för speglingsarkitekturen och namnkonventionen."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Fork PRs cannot publish packages themselves, so their untrusted `pull_request` runs wait in `scripts/meta/wait/mirrors.sh` until a trusted producer run has published the required refs."
msgstr "Fork PR kan inte publicera paket själva, så deras opålitliga `pull_request` Vänta i `scripts/meta/wait/mirrors.sh` tills en betrodd producentkörning har publicerat de nödvändiga referna."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Fork PRs run under the `pull_request` event without write permissions. Privileged steps (image builds, package writes) run via `pull_request_target`. The fork CI waits for those privileged images before proceeding. See [pull-request.md](pull-request.md) for the contributor-facing fork workflow."
msgstr "Fork PR körs under `pull_request` händelse utan att skriva behörigheter. Privilegierade steg (Bilden bygger, paketet skriver) kör via `pull_request_target`. Fork CI väntar på de privilegierade bilderna innan du fortsätter. Se [pull-request.md](pull-request.md) för bidragsgivaren inför gaffel arbetsflöde."

