# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "In `TLS_MODE=self_signed`, the role requires `CA_TRUST.cert_host`, `CA_TRUST.wrapper_host`, and `CA_TRUST.trust_name` and fails early if cert/wrapper files are missing."
msgstr "Inom `TLS_MODE=self_signed`, rollen kräver `CA_TRUST.cert_host`, `CA_TRUST.wrapper_host`, och `CA_TRUST.trust_name` och misslyckas tidigt om cert/wrapper filer saknas."

