# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Upstream ``host:port``: compose ``127.0.0.1:<local>``; swarm ``<entity>:<internal>`` (shared-overlay alias) for the app frontend, or ``<entity>_<service_key>:<internal>`` for named sidecars (sso-proxy). A ``host_gateway`` app runs node-local under swarm and publishes its local port to the host, so the overlay-attached proxy reaches it at ``host.docker.internal:<local>`` via the host gateway (the caller sets this off the real DEPLOYMENT_MODE, since such apps force a compose-style render). Missing swarm internal port hard-fails."
msgstr "Upstream ``host:port``: Komponera ``127.0.0.1:<local>``; svärm, ``<entity>:<internal>`` (Shared-overlay alias) för app frontend, eller ``<entity>_<service_key>:<internal>`` för namngivna sidovagnar (sso-proxy)Ett ``host_gateway`` app kör node-local under svärm och publicerar sin lokala hamn till värden, så den överliggande bifogade proxy når den på ``host.docker.internal:<local>`` via värdgateway (Uppmanaren sätter detta av det verkliga DEPLOYMENT_MODE, eftersom sådana appar tvingar en komposit-stil render)Saknar svärm inre hamn hårda fel."

